# Compiled binaries — never commit. Patterns are anchored or specific so they
# don't accidentally match a SOURCE directory named the same (e.g. cmd/mockserver/).
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
sftp-loadtest-mac-*
sftp-loadtest-linux-*
sftp-loadtest-windows-*
/mockserver
/mockserver-*
**/mockserver-*

# Release archives
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# Runtime state — created by the tool when it runs
**/reports/
**/schedules/
*.csv
*.csv.tmp

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Local-only Go workspace + vendored dep sources used to build behind a network
# block. Not committed; CI / network-connected hosts run `go mod tidy` instead.
go.work
go.work.sum
**/third_party/

# Wails desktop build artifacts (cmd/desktop). Templates under build/darwin,
# build/windows, build/appicon.png ARE committed. The bin/ output and the
# auto-generated frontend bindings are not.
**/cmd/desktop/build/bin/
**/cmd/desktop/frontend/wailsjs/

# Playwright e2e runner artifacts — created when the suite runs.
test-results/
playwright-report/
